{"id":"622147","name":"五彩饭","author":"凤梨小厨房","authorId":"8998709","desc":"","cover":"images/622147/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腊肠","amount":"3条"},{"name":"小鱿鱼干","amount":"4个"},{"name":"虾米","amount":"1小把"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"1根"},{"name":"豌豆","amount":"1碗"},{"name":"大米","amount":"2杯"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"所有材料如图备好。","img":"images/622147/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"油锅炒香腊肠鱿鱼虾米。","img":"images/622147/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入豌豆玉米翻炒。","img":"images/622147/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入少许盐调味。","img":"images/622147/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"电饭锅饭煮到水开。","img":"images/622147/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把炒好的料倒入饭上面，盖上盖子煮到跳闸。","img":"images/622147/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋入酱油，撒上葱花，拌匀。","img":"images/622147/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鱿鱼虾米的鲜香，加上玉米青豆的清甜，小孩子两下就能干掉一碗。","img":"images/622147/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}